<!doctype html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
<title>星座 성좌 · 점성과 타로의 천문관</title>
<meta name="description" content="17세기 천문 성도(星圖)에서 길어 올린 점성·타로카페. 서울 삼청동, 별의 언어로 당신의 길을 읽습니다." />
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cinzel:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Cormorant+Garamond:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;0,600;1,400;1,500&family=Noto+Serif+KR:wght@300;400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
<style>
  :root{
    --night:#1a2452;
    --night-deep:#0f1838;
    --night-abyss:#070b1c;
    --gold:#d4af37;
    --gold-soft:#e6c869;
    --gold-dim:#a8862b;
    --parchment:#e8e1cf;
    --ink:#cdd4e8;
    --ink-dim:#8a96b8;
    --line:rgba(212,175,55,0.28);
    --serif-display:'Cinzel',serif;
    --serif-body:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;
    --serif-kr:'Noto Serif KR',serif;
  }
  *{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box;}
  html{scroll-behavior:smooth;}
  body{
    font-family:var(--serif-kr);
    background:var(--night-deep);
    color:var(--ink);
    line-height:1.7;
    overflow-x:hidden;
    -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
  }
  ::selection{background:var(--gold);color:var(--night-abyss);}

  a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none;}
  img,svg{display:block;max-width:100%;}

  .wrap{max-width:1160px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 28px;}
  .latin{font-family:var(--serif-display);letter-spacing:0.22em;text-transform:uppercase;}
  .hanja{font-family:var(--serif-kr);}
  .gold{color:var(--gold);}

  /* starfield */
  .stars{position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:0;pointer-events:none;}
  .stars::before,.stars::after{
    content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;
    background-image:
      radial-gradient(1px 1px at 12% 22%, rgba(255,255,255,0.9), transparent),
      radial-gradient(1px 1px at 28% 68%, rgba(212,175,55,0.7), transparent),
      radial-gradient(1.5px 1.5px at 47% 14%, rgba(255,255,255,0.8), transparent),
      radial-gradient(1px 1px at 63% 82%, rgba(255,255,255,0.6), transparent),
      radial-gradient(1.5px 1.5px at 78% 34%, rgba(230,200,105,0.8), transparent),
      radial-gradient(1px 1px at 88% 58%, rgba(255,255,255,0.7), transparent),
      radial-gradient(1px 1px at 8% 88%, rgba(255,255,255,0.5), transparent),
      radial-gradient(1px 1px at 38% 44%, rgba(255,255,255,0.6), transparent),
      radial-gradient(1.5px 1.5px at 58% 56%, rgba(255,255,255,0.5), transparent),
      radial-gradient(1px 1px at 92% 90%, rgba(212,175,55,0.6), transparent);
    background-repeat:repeat;
    background-size:520px 520px;
  }
  .stars::after{background-size:760px 760px;opacity:0.5;animation:twinkle 7s ease-in-out infinite alternate;}
  @keyframes twinkle{from{opacity:0.25;}to{opacity:0.65;}}

  /* section frame */
  section{position:relative;z-index:1;}
  .eyebrow{
    font-family:var(--serif-display);
    font-size:0.72rem;letter-spacing:0.42em;text-transform:uppercase;
    color:var(--gold-dim);
    display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;justify-content:center;
  }
  .eyebrow::before,.eyebrow::after{content:"";height:1px;width:46px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,transparent,var(--gold-dim));}
  .eyebrow::after{background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--gold-dim),transparent);}

  h2.section-title{
    font-family:var(--serif-display);
    font-weight:600;
    font-size:clamp(1.9rem,4vw,3rem);
    color:var(--parchment);
    text-align:center;
    letter-spacing:0.08em;
    margin:18px 0 10px;
  }
  .section-sub{
    text-align:center;font-family:var(--serif-body);
    font-size:1.25rem;font-style:italic;color:var(--ink-dim);
    max-width:620px;margin:0 auto 56px;
  }

  /* ===== HERO ===== */
  .hero{
    min-height:100vh;
    display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
    text-align:center;
    background:
      radial-gradient(ellipse 90% 70% at 50% 38%, rgba(38,52,110,0.85), transparent 70%),
      radial-gradient(ellipse 120% 90% at 50% 120%, var(--night-abyss), transparent),
      linear-gradient(180deg,var(--night) 0%, var(--night-deep) 60%, var(--night-abyss) 100%);
    padding:120px 20px 80px;
    overflow:hidden;
  }
  .hero-inner{position:relative;z-index:2;}
  .celestial-frame{position:relative;width:min(560px,86vw);margin:0 auto 8px;aspect-ratio:1;}
  .celestial-frame .rotor{position:absolute;inset:0;animation:spin 120s linear infinite;}
  @keyframes spin{to{transform:rotate(360deg);}}
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.celestial-frame .rotor{animation:none;}.stars::after{animation:none;}}

  .hero h1{
    font-family:var(--serif-display);
    font-weight:700;
    font-size:clamp(3.2rem,11vw,6.4rem);
    color:var(--parchment);
    letter-spacing:0.12em;
    line-height:1;
    text-shadow:0 0 40px rgba(212,175,55,0.25);
  }
  .hero .hanja-mark{
    font-family:var(--serif-kr);
    font-size:clamp(1.1rem,3vw,1.5rem);
    color:var(--gold);letter-spacing:0.5em;
    margin-bottom:8px;
  }
  .hero .tagline{
    font-family:var(--serif-body);font-style:italic;
    font-size:clamp(1.15rem,2.6vw,1.6rem);
    color:var(--ink);margin-top:18px;letter-spacing:0.02em;
  }
  .hero .latin-sub{
    margin-top:26px;font-size:0.74rem;color:var(--gold-dim);
  }
  .hero-cta{
    display:inline-flex;gap:16px;margin-top:40px;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center;
  }
  .btn{
    font-family:var(--serif-display);
    font-size:0.78rem;letter-spacing:0.2em;text-transform:uppercase;
    padding:15px 32px;border:1px solid var(--gold);color:var(--gold);
    background:transparent;cursor:pointer;transition:all .4s ease;
    position:relative;
  }
  .btn:hover{background:var(--gold);color:var(--night-abyss);box-shadow:0 0 30px rgba(212,175,55,0.4);}
  .btn.solid{background:var(--gold);color:var(--night-abyss);}
  .btn.solid:hover{background:var(--gold-soft);}

  /* zodiac wheel (hero center overlay) */
  .zodiac-wheel{position:absolute;inset:0;display:grid;place-items:center;z-index:1;opacity:0.9;}

  /* ===== MENU (타로·점성) ===== */
  .menu{padding:110px 0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--night-abyss),var(--night-deep));}
  .menu-grid{
    display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:0;
    border:1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .menu-card{
    padding:42px 38px;
    border-right:1px solid var(--line);
    border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
    position:relative;
    transition:background .4s ease;
  }
  .menu-card:nth-child(2n){border-right:none;}
  .menu-card:nth-last-child(-n+2){border-bottom:none;}
  .menu-card:hover{background:rgba(38,52,110,0.4);}
  .menu-card .num{
    font-family:var(--serif-display);font-size:0.7rem;letter-spacing:0.3em;
    color:var(--gold-dim);
  }
  .menu-card h3{
    font-family:var(--serif-kr);font-weight:500;font-size:1.5rem;
    color:var(--parchment);margin:10px 0 4px;
  }
  .menu-card .h3-latin{font-family:var(--serif-body);font-style:italic;font-size:1.05rem;color:var(--gold);margin-bottom:14px;}
  .menu-card p{font-size:0.96rem;color:var(--ink-dim);margin-bottom:20px;min-height:54px;}
  .menu-card .price{
    font-family:var(--serif-display);font-size:1.1rem;color:var(--gold-soft);
    letter-spacing:0.08em;display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:8px;
  }
  .menu-card .price small{font-size:0.7rem;color:var(--ink-dim);letter-spacing:0.1em;}
  .menu-icon{position:absolute;top:34px;right:34px;width:44px;height:44px;opacity:0.55;}

  /* ===== HOROSCOPE (별자리 운세) ===== */
  .horo{padding:110px 0;background:
    radial-gradient(ellipse 80% 60% at 50% 0%, rgba(38,52,110,0.5), transparent),
    var(--night-deep);}
  .horo-grid{
    display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:18px;
  }
  .sign{
    border:1px solid var(--line);
    padding:26px 18px;text-align:center;
    transition:all .4s ease;cursor:default;
    background:rgba(15,24,56,0.5);
  }
  .sign:hover{border-color:var(--gold);transform:translateY(-4px);box-shadow:0 14px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.4);}
  .sign .glyph{
    font-size:1.8rem;color:var(--gold);line-height:1;margin-bottom:10px;
    font-family:'Noto Serif KR',serif;
  }
  .sign .name-kr{font-family:var(--serif-kr);font-size:1.05rem;color:var(--parchment);font-weight:500;}
  .sign .name-latin{font-family:var(--serif-body);font-style:italic;font-size:0.92rem;color:var(--gold-dim);}
  .sign .date{font-size:0.72rem;color:var(--ink-dim);margin-top:8px;letter-spacing:0.05em;}

  /* ===== RESERVE (예약) ===== */
  .reserve{padding:110px 0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--night-deep),var(--night-abyss));}
  .reserve-inner{
    max-width:760px;margin:0 auto;border:1px solid var(--line);
    padding:54px clamp(28px,5vw,64px);position:relative;
    background:rgba(15,24,56,0.55);
  }
  .corner{position:absolute;width:26px;height:26px;border:1px solid var(--gold);}
  .corner.tl{top:-1px;left:-1px;border-right:none;border-bottom:none;}
  .corner.tr{top:-1px;right:-1px;border-left:none;border-bottom:none;}
  .corner.bl{bottom:-1px;left:-1px;border-right:none;border-top:none;}
  .corner.br{bottom:-1px;right:-1px;border-left:none;border-top:none;}
  .form-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:20px;margin-bottom:20px;}
  .field{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;}
  .field.full{grid-column:1/-1;}
  .field label{
    font-family:var(--serif-display);font-size:0.66rem;letter-spacing:0.24em;
    text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--gold-dim);
  }
  .field input,.field select,.field textarea{
    background:rgba(7,11,28,0.6);border:1px solid var(--line);
    color:var(--parchment);font-family:var(--serif-kr);font-size:0.96rem;
    padding:13px 15px;outline:none;transition:border .3s ease;
  }
  .field input:focus,.field select:focus,.field textarea:focus{border-color:var(--gold);}
  .field textarea{resize:vertical;min-height:96px;}
  .reserve .btn{width:100%;margin-top:10px;}

  /* ===== CONTACT ===== */
  .contact{padding:100px 0 60px;background:var(--night-abyss);}
  .contact-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.2fr 1fr;gap:48px;align-items:center;}
  .contact h2{font-family:var(--serif-display);font-size:clamp(1.8rem,4vw,2.6rem);color:var(--parchment);letter-spacing:0.06em;margin-bottom:8px;}
  .contact .quote{font-family:var(--serif-body);font-style:italic;font-size:1.3rem;color:var(--gold);margin-bottom:28px;}
  .info-line{display:flex;gap:14px;padding:14px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);}
  .info-line .k{font-family:var(--serif-display);font-size:0.66rem;letter-spacing:0.22em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--gold-dim);min-width:88px;padding-top:3px;}
  .info-line .v{font-size:0.98rem;color:var(--ink);}
  .hours-card{border:1px solid var(--line);padding:32px;background:rgba(15,24,56,0.5);}
  .hours-card h4{font-family:var(--serif-display);font-size:0.78rem;letter-spacing:0.2em;color:var(--gold);margin-bottom:18px;text-transform:uppercase;}
  .hours-card .hrow{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:0.92rem;padding:7px 0;color:var(--ink-dim);}
  .hours-card .hrow span:last-child{color:var(--parchment);}

  footer{
    text-align:center;padding:40px 20px;background:var(--night-abyss);
    border-top:1px solid var(--line);
  }
  footer .mark{font-family:var(--serif-display);letter-spacing:0.3em;color:var(--gold);font-size:0.9rem;}
  footer .small{font-size:0.74rem;color:var(--ink-dim);margin-top:10px;letter-spacing:0.04em;}

  @media (max-width:860px){
    .horo-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);}
    .contact-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:32px;}
  }
  @media (max-width:600px){
    .menu-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
    .menu-card{border-right:none !important;}
    .menu-card:nth-last-child(2){border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);}
    .form-row{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
    .horo-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;}
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div style="position:fixed;top:0;left:0;right:0;z-index:9999;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:8px 16px;background:rgba(7,11,20,0.94);backdrop-filter:blur(8px);border-bottom:2px solid #ffb000;font-family:ui-monospace,'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.08em;">
  <a href="/portfolio" style="color:#ffb000;text-decoration:none;white-space:nowrap;">← PORTFOLIO</a>
  <span style="color:#8ea0b8;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap;">SAMPLE 38 · 성좌 — 17세기 천문 성도 스타일</span>
  <a href="/contact" style="color:#070b14;background:#ffb000;padding:6px 12px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700;white-space:nowrap;border-radius:2px;">제작 문의 →</a>
